    <description>24 Oct 24:VRa: Removed Check for environment, added formula to get current domain from custom label
23 Oct 24:VRa: Update to registration link in setUrlInfix component
capitalized &quot;The&quot; in TTS
With CC to Order Owner/Decision Maker
With Workflow User trigger
With new URL format
With invocable variables for Recipient Name
With add reserved seats
With null to 0 on reserved seats
With inputs for refactored invocable to avoid call in for
With get group recipients not registered instead of equals created
With apex invocable to avoid updates in for loop for reserved seats
With check for allocations in invocable
With dynamic domain</description>
